  "explanation": "The question asks for the location of 'Mooretown'. Two distinct referents are identified in the sources: (1) Moore Town, Jamaica, a Maroon settlement described in documents D1S1-D1S2 and D1S6, and (2) the Mooretown Rancheria of Maidu Indians in California, described in D2S1-D2S5. Each has its own valid location claims. The phrase 'eastern end of the parish' refers to Moore Town, Jamaica, as stated in D1S2. These three answers are complementary and non-conflicting across two distinct referents."
